Well, I was hacking away a couple days ago, and all of a sudden I turned into a
Giant Mummy!  No sign of a wand being zapped at me (at least no message to that
effect), no ring of polymorph.  I went back to the site, and there was no
evidence of a trap.  Any ideas?

ObAnnoyingDeath:

Valkyrie puts on cursed helmet, wants to get rid of it; I'm on about level 2 of
the dungeon at the time.  I find a fountain and dip.  I release a water demon.

But wait, it gets better.  The water demon is glad to be released and grants me
a wish.  I've tried Vorpal Blade, and while it was a good weapon, I wasn't
impressed.  I wish for Mjollnir, and from then until my death every monster I
meet dies on the first SWING (it doesn't seem to miss).  The helmet is still
cursed, though (badly), and my AC sucks, so down on level 3 or 4 I find another
fountain, and dip.  Water demon again.

No problem, I think.  I've finished off TWO water demons with a 7th level Elf
before, and Mjollnir hasn't let anything survive a hit (and no misses!) yet....

Next message I see:  The water demon zaps an aluminum wand at you!  The sleep
ray hits you!  The sleep ray hits Pixel!

AAARRRRGGGGHHHHH!!!!!!

Game over, man.

I hadn't even realized that water demons were created with items, let alone a
wand of sleep (ACK!).

